        "action_date": "2025-09-04",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p>This bill prohibits camping outdoors on public property in the District of Columbia. The penalty for a violation of the prohibition is a fine of up to $500, imprisonment for up to 30 days, or both.</p>",
